  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solomon Islands &#x2013; Australia Partnership for Economic Governance (2022 &#x2013; 2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Solomon Islands&#x2013;Australia Partnership for Economic Governance aims to strengthen accountable and inclusive economic governance in partnership with the Government of Solomon Islands. To achieve the investment&#x2019;s overarching objective, the program focuses on three key areas: strengthening effective and accountable public financial management systems, promoting sustainable fiscal management, and incentivizing economic reform.</narrative>
  </description>
